OL,3,GNEWSATwo arson arrests after flat fire
OL,4,
OL,5,FTwo people have been arrested on
OL,6,Fsuspicion of arson after a flat fire.
OL,8,FDerbyshire Police said they were called
OL,9,Fto reports of a fire in Burns Street,
OL,10,FIlkeston, at 16:40 BST on Thursday.
OL,12,FA man and a woman, both in their 30s,
OL,13,Fwere arrested at the scene on suspicion
OL,14,Fof arson. They both remain in police
OL,15,Fcustody.
OL,17,FThe arrested woman was taken to
OL,18,Fhospital and was treated for injuries
OL,19,Fwhich are not thought to be serious.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
